  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-sar-urban-mapping.\n\n- Extracts urban/built-up areas from single-temporal SAR backscatter using Otsu/fixed \u03c3\u2070 threshold, GLCM contrast texture, and morphological closing.\n- Supports both real SAR GeoTIFF input and fully offline synthetic data generation.\n- Outputs include a binary urban extent GeoTIFF mask and urban area statistics (JSON).\n- All processing is done locally; no data upload or external network required.\n- Usage examples and dependency instructions provided for quick start.",
